### Get customer transactions
GET{{host}}/transactions/customer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

### Get group transactions
GET{{host}}/transactions/group/4e07052f-4bd0-4f2d-ac80-53d776c9e49b
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

### Get user'sgroup transactions
GET{{host}}/transactions/group/4e07052f-4bd0-4f2d-ac80-53d776c9e49b/customer/054a080c-453e-44cc-8476-119e5f9765c6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}